\pxi-3,l4,t4;1.^IALL DIMENSIONS ARE IN MILLIMETER EXCEPT OTHERWISE STATED.\P2.^IALL BRICK WORK TO BE IN CEMENT MORTAR (1:4).\P3.^IDEPTH AND SIZE OF FOUNDATION MAY VARY ACCORDING TO THE LOCAL CONDITIONS.\P4.^IHEIGHT OF PLINTH MAY VARY ACCORDING TO LOCAL C
  3
ONDITION BUT IN NO CASE SHOULD BE LESS THAN 750 MM.\P5.^IFOR DETAIL OF R. C. C. SUN SHADE AND LINTEL SEE CONSTRUCTION DETAILS SHEET.\P6.^IALL R. C. C SUNSHADE ARE 450 MM PROJECTED OUT.\P7.^IALL PARTITION WALL 125 MM THICK EXCEPT OTHERWISE STATED.\P8.^IBO
  3
TH INSIDE AND OUTSIDE OF THE BUILDING TO BE 12 MM THK. CEMENT PLASTERED WITH (1:4) RESPECTIVELY EXCEPT OTHERWISE STATED.\P9.^IIN TOILET MIN. SLOPE 1 IN 40 TO BE MAINTAINED TOWARDS OUTLET.\P10.^IALL DOORS & WINDOW FRAMES ARE SAL WOOD (75 MM x 125 MM) AL
  3
L PLANKS ARE GAMARI WOOD (38 MM THK.).\P11.^IALL WOOD AND IRON WORKS TO BE PAINTED TWO COATS OVER PRIMING COAT WITH APPROVED SHADE.\P12.^ITOP EDGE OF COOKING PLATFORM TO BE FINISHED WITH GRANITE 25 MM THK. OF APPROVED SHADE.\P13.^IWALL UP TO 600 MM HEIG
  3
HT ABOVE THE COOKING PLATFORM AND SINK TO BE PROVIDED WITH CERAMIC GLAZED TILES OF APPROVED SHADE.\P14.^ISYNTHETIC WATER TANK TO BE PROVIDED OVER FLAT ROOF WITH MIN. 2000 LITRE CAPACITY EACH PER UNIT.\P15.^ICERAMIC TILES UPTO A HEIGHT OF 2100 MM TO BE 
  3
PROVIDED IN ALL TOILETS.\P16.^IORISSA TYPE W. C. PAN / COMMODE / WASH BASIN & TOILET ACCESSORIES TO BE PROVIDED AS SPECIFIED.\P17.^ISEPTIC TANK AS PER DETAILS PROVIDED IN THIS SHEET.\P18.^IFLOOR OF ALL AREAS TO BE FINISHED WITH VITRIFIED TILES OF APPROV
  3
ED SHADE EXCEPT OTHERWISE STATED.\P19.^IMIRROR WITH CHROMIUM PLATED ADJUSTABLE BRACKET TO BE PROVIDED AS SPECIFIED BY THE SITE ENGINEER.\P20.^IWINDOWS SHALL BE OF POWDER COATED ALUMINUM SLIDING / FIXED TYPE AND ONE EXTRA PANEL FOR MOSQUITO NET TO BE PR
  3
OVIDED IN SLIDING AREAS. \P21.^IINSIDE WALL TO BE WATER BOUND DISTEMPERED.\P22.^IPELMETS FOR FIXING CURTAIN TO BE PROVIDED IN ALL DOORS AND WINDOWS EXCEPT KITCHEN AND TOILETS.\P23.^IOUT SIDE OF THE BUILDING TO BE COLOR WASHED OF APPROVED SHADE.\P24.^IM. 
  3
S. GRILL TO BE PROVIDED FOR SPECIFIED WINDOWS, FOR DETAILS SEE SEPARATE SHEET.\P25.^IVITRIFIED FLOOR IN ALL ROOMS EXCEPT OTHERWISE STATED.\P26.^IFOR STRUCTURAL DRAWINGS AND DETAILS SEE SEPARATE DRAWING FOR COLUMN, BEAM, STAIR, ROOF SLAB AND OTHER STRUC
  3
TURAL ELEMENTS.\P27.^IALL ELECTRICAL WIRING WILL BE CONCEALED.\P28.^IDECORATIVE FALSE CEILING / WALL PANELING WILL BE PROVIDED AS SPECIFIED BY THE SITE ENGINEER. \P29.^ITRUSS SECTION HAS BEEN DESIGNED FOR INDIAN SECTION.\P30.^IYIELD STRENGTH OF THE TRUSS
  3
 SECTION TO BE 250 N/SQ.MM\P31.^IALL STRUCTURAL STEEL SHALL CONFORM TO IS 226-1975, IS 2062-2006, IS 4923-1997.\P32.^ITHE DETAILS ARE BASED ON THE WORST DESIGN LOADING FOR THE GROUP.\P33.^IOPEN ENDS OF ALL MEMBER SHALL BE SEALED.\P34.^ITEMPLATE MUST BE D
  3
ONE FIRST AT GROUND AND CONFIRMED BY THE STRUCTURAL ENGINEER AND THEN FABRICATION OF THE THE TRUSS SHOULD BE STARTED.\P35.^ISUITABLE CARE SHOULD BE TAKEN DURING ERECTION OF THE STRUCTURE.\P36.^ITHE DIMENSION AS STATED IN THE DRAWING SHALL BE FROM CENTR
  3
E TO CENTRE OF THE MEMBERS. ACTUAL DIMENSION SHALL BE DETERMINED DURING FINALIZATION OF THE TEMPLATE AT SITE.\P37.^IALL GUSSET PLATE SHALL BE OF 8MM (UNLESS STATED OTHERWISE) THICK AND SHALL CONFORM TO IS 2062-2006.\P38.^IALL WELDING SHALL BE OF 6MM FI
  3
LLET CONTINUOUS EXCEPT WHERE RESTRICTED DUE TO LESSER THICKNESS OF THE MEMBERS. DURING WELDING CARE SHOULD BE TAKEN SO THAT NO DISTORTION IS TAKING PLACE IN THE PARENT MATERIAL.\P39.^IANCHOR BOLTS SHALL BE OF 25 MM DIA. AND HOLE 26.5 MM DIA AND SHALL 
  3
CONFORM TO IS 1367-2002. \P40.^ISECTIONAL PROPERTIES FOR STRUCTURAL ELEMENTS OF TRUSS:\P\pl5,t7;a.^I72 MM X 72 MM X 4 MM,      8.22 Kg/m\Pb.^I50 MM X 50 MM X 3.6 MM,    4.98 Kg/m\Pc.^I91.5 MM X 91.5 MM X 3.6MM, 13.32 Kg/m\Pd.^I50 MM X 50 MM X4.5 MM,      
  1
 6.02 Kg/m
